// Dialog :
"P1700204786" "Excellent job, {HeroName}. Our operatives have moved in to stomp out the remaining Longbow in the area. They'll have it under control momentarily.<br><br>You say that this operation is being led by a hero named the Golden Palm? Hrm, I'm inclined to believe you, given the idiotic name of the hero.<br><br>Well, {HeroName}, why don't you and I see what it takes to <i>crush</i> a hero beneath our boots?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Longbow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1455175237" "You! I've seen you in the reports!<br><br>Do your <i>worst</i> to me, I'll never tell you anything, you hear me?!<br><br>I swore an oath to fight evil wherever I see it, and <i>you</i> are part of that!"
// Answer Text :
"P2575251370" "(Break the man's leg)"
// Answer Text :
"P2713065963" "(Break the man's arm)"
// Answer Text :
"P2956457795" "(Describe in painful detail what you could possibly do to the man.)"
// Page BreakLegs Text :
"P3196481032" "<color orange>You hear a rough SNAP as you break the man's leg.</color><br><br>AAAAGH! M-my leg! I-I can't... you...<br><br>Stop... please... stop! I'll tell you anything!"
// Answer Text :
"P2412714510" "You grunts -do- break easily. Where is the Longbow base located?"
// Page BreakArm Text :
"P3497848889" "<color orange>You hear a rough SNAP as you break the man's arm</color><br><br>AAAAGH! M-my arm! I can't... it hurts so much...!<br><br>Stop... please... stop! I'll tell you anything!"
// Answer Text :
"P3550884988" "You weren't that tough after all. Where is  your Longbow base located?"
// Page PainfulDetail Text :
"P4133394033" "<color orange>The man's face grows pale as you painfully detail what you could do to him using your abilities. He cuts you off after two minutes of talking.</color><br><br>A-alright! Stop! Please!<br><br>Just... don't do <i>any</i> of that, I'll talk!"
// Answer Text :
"P2405478477" "Happy we could come to an agreement. Tell me where your base is located."
// Page Location Text :
"P2278664646" "W-we have two bases... I haven't been to the main one... but there's another in an office here in Mercy.<br><br>I-if you wanted to take it out, y-you could find the codes on Longbow technicians to issue a fake message to gather on the top floor. E-everyone would head over to there, y-you could do whatever you want!<br><br>Now, please, just... just leave me alone!"
// Answer Text :
"P1646021799" "Not a bad plan. I think I'll do just that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Kuzmin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3584324069" "{HeroName}, I can see the smoke billowing from here. Excellent work.<br><br>The prisoner mentioned that there was a main base, correct? Even better for us, then. I believe I may have a method for us to locate this base.<br><br>Longbow will not know what hit them, you will be safe, and the power of Arachnos <i>will</i> be seen by those fools."
// Answer Text :
"P3292084520" "What is your idea?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3957827860" "One of the issues with finding Longbow in Mercy is the large amount of areas they could be hiding, like the rats they are.<br><br>However, we have methods of retrieving this information. Most of your typical Longbow grunts will not be able to withstand your most base levels of torture.<br><br>We have such a grunt in our... 'custody' now. I will give you the honors of delivering your own form of interrogation on the boy."
// AcceptString :
"P1918505952" "Alright. Where is this grunt?"
// SendOffString :
"P570693049" "In the area where we were previously battling Longbow.<br><br>Oh, and {HeroName}, before I forget. You should consider yourself what we in Arachnos call a <color yellow>Destined One</color> now. You are destined for something great, you see, much like many of the others. Whether or not you can achieve this destiny is based upon your own strength and mettle.<br><br>This is what Longbow fears, and what we in Arachnos seek to nurture. When you are done, you may contact me with your communication device.<br><br><color orange>After completing missions for contacts, you can gain the ability to call them up from any point in the world to receive further missions.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3059878672" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Boom, You're All Dead</color>"

