// Page TaskOwner Text :
"P3683814513" "<color orange>You see the villain, Dario Stanzini, laying prone on the ground.<br><br>If something isn't done, he'll die in the fire.<br><br>You notice that he has an emergency teleporter on him, which was previously disabled by Longbow. Activating it will save his life.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3198565049" "(Save Dario Stanzini)"
// Answer Text :
"P3678392066" "(Kill Dario Stanzini)"
// Answer Text :
"P3719527218" "(Leave him to die)"
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P26213660" "<color orange>Only the task owner can decide the fate of Dario Stanzini.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page Save Text :
"P3644897301" "<color orange>You activate the teleporter, sending Dario Stanzini back to safety!</color>"
// Page KillVillain Text :
"P3969450925" "<color orange>You use your abilities to swiftly kill Dario Stanzini!</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P912498689" "We intercepted a distress call from the Longbow office you blew up. Our technicians were able to determine where it was going. Their last attempt to try to survive will lead their comrades straight to their doom.<br><br>There is one thing, however. We've traced them back to a lab, which is most likely well fortified inside of it. I've pulled up the schematics and have seen numerous blast doors located within.<br><br>If you're going to assault the base, you'll need a better way in than destroying anyone who stands in your way."
// AcceptString :
"P278931335" "And you have a suggestion?"
// SendOffString :
"P4034512743" "I do. Disguise yourself as one of them.<br><br>I assume there will be a front guard of Longbow at the entrance. If you take them out, you can make yourself a disguise to get in there and get to the heart of the facility.<br><br>From there, you can overload their systems, causing a catastrophic explosion. You'll also, if all goes well, have the... <i>pleasure</i> of facing against Golden Palm. I wish you luck in your expedition, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1483352638" "Destroy Longbow's Base in Mercy"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3427027018" "The longer we wait, the higher the chance that Longbow will get away!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P102269756" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Making an Impression</color>"

