// Dialog :
"P2198586323" "Excellent work, {HeroName}. There are still a few stragglers left in Mercy City, but as long as their main base is gone, we'll leave them be. After all, we need something to keep the Rogue Isles Police on their toes, hrm?<br><br>You and I are done for now, however. There is much still for me to do, and you, {HeroName}, have the rest of your destiny to fulfill. I'm quite interested to see where exactly you will go from here."

